    "body": "Just as a note on this - I just made a quick test with chrome.serial and it's VERY useful to get at least this little bundle of info while scanning (same device - different OS):\n\n// Linux:\n// displayName: \"STM32_Virtual_COM_Port\"\n// path: \"/dev/ttyACM2\"\n// productId: 22336\n// vendorId: 1155\n\n// Windows:\n// displayName: \"STMicroelectronics Virtual COM Port\"\n// path: \"COM4\"\n// productId: 22336\n// vendorId: 1155\n",
